{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Headbutt Knights</i>, players dive into a fast-paced and absurd top-down 2D pixel art action game where the only way to defeat endless waves of monsters is by smashing them with powerful headbutts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op mode and battle through arenas infested with grotesque creatures. Explore different environments filled with traps, power-ups, and hidden secrets. Upgrade your skull with ridiculous abilities like flaming horns, seismic explosions, or rocket-powered headbutts, and unleash devastating combos to achieve high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as possible, dodge enemy attacks, and take on colossal bosses. Only the toughest (and hardest-headed!) will come out victorious. Are you ready to smash everything in your path?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552740?t=1773340503","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552740/ab2ea488699e79bc7e603f3d4d423286c83393b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773340503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552740/f69237f108dc71646227f58975ebde633bb299cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773340503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552740/f69237f108dc71646227f58975ebde633bb299cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773340503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Headbutt Knights</i>, players dive into a fast-paced and absurd top-down 2D pixel art action game where the only way to de